| `agents/wiki_navigator/` | Answers questions from the wiki corpus, with citations and provenance. Unreadable retrieval reports raise the shared `ToolReportUnreadable` before backend construction in dry-run and execute modes; MCP returns `isError=true` with no model call. | through `mcp/qa_server.py` | [`agents.max_model_calls`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`corpus.served_visibilities`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Answers from the built corpus only, using the served levels of the checkout that keeps it through retrieval, synthesis and citations; `agents/index_enforcer/` builds the corpus. An empty query list keeps an empty dry-run preview; execute refuses empty context. A nonzero query keeps plain `RuntimeError`. An answer is one model call, and `answer(execute=True)` with no approved count is a `ValueError`. | [agent-runtimes.md](../guides/agent-runtimes.md) | always |
